in San Jose, California, who says,
她说：

53
00:02:36.140 --> 00:02:37.160
Hi, ladies.
嗨，女士们.

54
00:02:37.380 --> 00:02:45.280
I met Angela at the Fan Expo convention in San Francisco last year, and she gave me an Office Lady's lunchbox.
去年我在旧金山的粉丝博览会上遇到了安吉拉，她送了我一个“办公室女士”的饭盒.

55
00:02:45.700 --> 00:02:47.340
I absolutely love it.
我太喜欢它了.

56
00:02:47.460 --> 00:02:49.280
I have it on my shelf in my office.
我把它摆在我办公室的书架上.

57
00:02:49.820 --> 00:02:55.800
It got me thinking back to my grade school days and how I would get to pick a new lunchbox each year for school.
这让我想起了我的小学时代，以及我每年上学时都可以挑选一个新的饭盒.

58
00:02:56.140 --> 00:02:59.440
My favorite was the year I got a Wonder Woman lunchbox.
我最喜欢的是我得到神奇女侠饭盒的那一年.

59
00:02:59.860 --> 00:03:03.680
